<title>CHILE: Airline Lan Chile buys rival Ladeco.</title>
<headline>Airline Lan Chile buys rival Ladeco.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's largest airline Lan Chile has bought 99.4 percent of rival carrier Ladeco for $38.4 million, Lan Chile said in a statement to the Stocks and Values Superintendency.</p>
<p>Lan Chile bought San Alberto SA, a company linked to Lan's majority shareholders, which owned 99.4 percent of Ladeco.</p>
<p>&quot;Ladeco now becomes a subsidiary of Lan Chile, beginning a stage of consolidation and growth,&quot; said the statement.</p>
<p>(( -- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
